# Git Workflow Rules

## 🌿 Branch Naming (BẮT BUỘC)
```
<type>/PROJ-<id>-<short-desc>

feature/PROJ-123-add-oauth-google
bugfix/PROJ-456-fix-timer
hotfix/PROJ-789-critical-fix
refactor/PROJ-234-extract-service
docs/PROJ-345-update-readme
test/PROJ-456-add-e2e
chore/PROJ-567-update-deps
```

## 📝 Commit Format (Conventional Commits - BẮT BUỘC)
```
<type>(<scope>): <subject>

<body>

<footer>
```

### Types
- `feat` - Tính năng mới
- `fix` - Bug fix
- `docs` - Tài liệu
- `style` - Format code
- `refactor` - Refactor
- `perf` - Performance
- `test` - Thêm/sửa test
- `chore` - Build, deps
- `ci` - CI/CD
- `revert` - Revert

### Scope (service name)
`(auth)`, `(content)`, `(exam)`, `(ai)`, `(blockchain)`, `(analytics)`, `(notification)`, `(web)`, `(deps)`, `(ci)`

### Rules
- Subject ≤ 72 ký tự
- Imperative mood ("add" not "added")
- NO viết hoa chữ cái đầu
- NO dấu chấm cuối
- Reference Jira ticket ở footer: `Refs: PROJ-123`

## ✅ EXAMPLES
```bash
git commit -m "feat(auth): add Google OAuth2 login

Add Google as OAuth2 provider. User can now sign in with Google
account. Existing users can link their Google account from settings.

- Add GoogleOAuthProvider
- Update LoginUseCase to handle OAuth
- Add tests for OAuth flow

Refs: PROJ-123"

git commit -m "fix(exam): correct timer countdown when tab inactive

Fix timer that pauses when user switches tab. Now uses
performance.now() for accurate time tracking.

Fixes: PROJ-456"
```

## ❌ NEVER
- `git commit -m "update"`
- `git commit -m "fix bug"`
- `git commit -m "WIP"`
- Commit trực tiếp vào main/develop
- Force push sau khi review started

